{"id":"1e9048cd-ad7e-4452-807b-64dbc06dfe07","title":"Offsets 1","slug":"offsets-1","collectionSlug":"offsets","collectionName":"Offsets","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A dynamic gradient shader effect dominated by flowing purple and blue tones transitioning smoothly across the canvas. The primary FlowingGradient component creates a soft, organic color transition from white (#ffffff) through vibrant purple (#6b17e6) to deeper violet (#9d35ff) and bright blue (#684dff). The gradient exhibits a liquid, flowing quality with speed set to 3.5, creating gentle wave-like motion throughout. Overlaid on this base are rectangular geometric shapes with soft, blurred edges that appear to float across the composition - these are created by the GridDistortion component with a gridSize of 6 and intensity of 1.5, producing a subtle warping effect that breaks up the smooth gradient into organic rectangular patches. The BarShift component with 6 count adds subtle horizontal striations with 15% intensity, creating fine linear texture variations. A BlueNoise overlay with 25% opacity and overlay blend mode adds fine grain texture throughout, enhancing the depth and preventing the gradient from appearing too smooth. The overall effect is ethereal and atmospheric, with soft transitions between light and dark areas, creating a sense of depth and movement. The color space uses oklab for smooth perceptual transitions, and the edges are set to transparent, allowing the effect to blend seamlessly. The mood is modern, digital, and calming with a sophisticated purple-to-blue color palette.","colors":["#ffffff","#6b17e6","#684dff","#9d35ff"],"labels":["gradient","organic","textured","calm"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/1e9048cd-ad7e-4452-807b-64dbc06dfe07.jpg","toneMapping":"neutral","components":[{"type":"FlowingGradient","id":"idmsq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","_key":"key_msq3j7yazb9j5e4jd","props":{"seed":0,"speed":3.5,"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#6b17e6","colorC":"#684dff","colorD